cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in research, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Carter/KKT Tesseract"
abstract: >-
  A hard-constrained differentiable Carter/KKT Vulkan simulator evolved from
  a parity-gated scalar recurrence, with piecewise-constant hard decisions,
  progressive full-physics unrolling, Lyapunov-conditioned dynamics, and a
  coupled CCZ4 two-current numerical-relativity PDE reference backend.
type: software
authors:
