url: "https://github.com/rynchpman-cmyk/carter-kkt-tesseract"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-07-24
keywords:
  - automatic differentiation
  - differentiable physics
  - dynamical systems
  - KKT conditions
  - Lyapunov conditioning
  - numerical relativity
  - CCZ4
  - relativistic multifluid dynamics
  - Slang
  - Vulkan
